  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 303.01 Scope. The licensing rules of this chapter shall not apply to anyone who meets the exceptions and complies with this part.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15; (formerly Saf-Mec 303.01); ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36",
